    "reviews": "\u201cI recommend The Black Knight to lovers of 2D platform games with pixelated metroidvania-style graphics. The game is extremely difficult, even with all its simplicity, it was developed in a way that makes the gameplay a great challenge for the player.\u201d<br />\r\nNave dos Gamers<br />\r\n",
